<title>TMG 3.1: Bigger / Better - Richfield PA 17086 - Ends Sunday 11/9 @ 9PM EST</title>
<description>[b]Too Many Games Auction 3.1: Bigger/Better[/b]

This is my third BGG auction, and I’m trying something new this time around. I’m actually running two separate auctions at the same time with staggered end times. The idea is that after this auction ends, there will still be an opportunity to lock in some additional items from my second auction to take advantage of combined shipping. 

[i]See my “Smaller / Cheaper” auction here.  (Ends 11/9 @ 10PM EST)[/i]
https://boardgamegeek.com/geeklist/366171/tmg-32-smaller-cheaper-richfield-pa-17086-ends-sun

1. All games list a soft reserve and a BIN. Anything beyond the soft reserve will guarantee a sale. Anything below the soft reserve will still be considered but may not be accepted. (Sales outside the auction may trump bids. Please see numbers 8,9, and 10 below.)

2. Please only bid on an item if you fully intend to purchase. Do not retract bids without first messaging me.

3. All bids must be in whole dollars.

4. Shipping is from 17086 and will be paid by the winner. Message me if you would like to consider local pickup. I may be willing to drive a bit to meet up if it’s beneficial to the deal. Otherwise, I will ship as quickly as possible but may have to track down some boxes, depending on items purchased. Please be patient. (Combined shipping available with my second auction linked above.)
4b. US bidders only please.

5. Payments accepted via Paypal only. (Cash accepted/preferred for local pickup.)

6. This particular auction will run until 9:00 PM EST (6:00 PM PST) on Sunday, November 9, 2025. Bids after this time will not be considered valid, aside from the following exception. Individual items will not be considered closed until 5 minutes has passed from the previous bid. (After 9:00PM, items will automatically close, unless active bidding is occurring.) I hope this makes sense to everyone. 

7. Please ask any questions prior to bidding. I will do my best to respond to any comments or messages as quickly as possible. I usually log in to BGG daily.

8. I reserve the right to add, remove, or update items at any time, at my discretion. If an item has been BIN'd, I will not retract that item.
8b. Subscribe to this list to ensure that you don't miss any additions or updates. (I anticipate some additions, if my schedule allows.)

9. Although not likely, I may accept bundle BIN offers via PM, particularly for larger bundle purchase requests.

10. If interested in items that have not met the soft reserve by auction end, please feel free to message me.

11. Items will be represented to the best of my ability. Many of these games are in like-new condition, having been played only a few times or not at all. A large amount of my collection has been obtained via second-hand stores, yard sales, other BGG users, etc., so I do not know the history of each item. There may be minor flaws that have gone unnoticed by me, especially if I never got around to playing the game myself.

Thank you for participating in my auction!</description>

